$NAMESPACE ip_audit

% IP_AUDIT_LOAD_OK ip-audit hook loaded with %1 sink(s)
Informational message logged when the hook library has been loaded and
all configured sinks were created.

% IP_AUDIT_LOAD_FAILED ip-audit hook failed to load: %1
The hook parameters were invalid or a sink could not be created. The
server will refuse to load the library.

% IP_AUDIT_UNLOAD ip-audit hook unloaded
Informational message logged when the hook library is unloaded.

% IP_AUDIT_SINK_CREATED sink '%1' of type '%2' created
Informational message logged for every sink created at load time.

% IP_AUDIT_SINK_WRITE_FAILED sink '%1' failed to write record: %2
A sink could not store an audit record. Other sinks are unaffected and
DHCP processing continues.

% IP_AUDIT_CALLOUT_FAILED unable to process event '%1': %2
An unexpected error occurred while building an audit record. DHCP
processing continues.
